maria: we'll update pagination examples to use `cursor_id` and `page_size` param names that match current SDK. add migration note: "If resuming across restarts, persist `cursor_id` securely and verify TTL/expiry on resume." Also clarify semantics of `limit` vs `page_size`.
rahul: i'll add a tiny fixture to mock streaming responses and assert the async snippet yields expected sequence. keeps docs CI honest.
lee: branching: `docs/snippets/streaming/refactor-pytsgo` with subfolders. i'll open TS PR and tag @maria @sasha for review.
maria: i'll create the umbrella PR (bundle the three languages) — PR #4892 — target merge by Fri EOD. will run previews first.
sasha: also add a note about KV-cache draining in the Go doc to prevent cache corruption during reconnects.
